      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) Reconstitute and expand the authority of the Mayor's Council Against Poverty as a new body, with broad citizen representation constituting a cross-section of all City elements, of which government would be one, with special emphasis, however, on providing representation for those groups most burdened with poverty and discrimination, hence constituting the \"target population.\"",
